---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="System Status"
  description="Live status of the FinDyn serving plane, compute plane, and D1 feature store."
  eyebrow="Instrument panel"
  heading="System status"
  intro="What is running, what last ingested, and what is still ahead. Everything on this page is read from the live API by your browser; nothing is baked into the page."
>
  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="engines-h">
    <div class="panel__head">
      <h2 id="engines-h">Engines</h2>
      <span class="panel__note">/api/v1/assets</span>
    </div>
    <p class="prose">
      One card per registered asset engine, read from the registry rather than from whatever
      happens to be in the database — an engine that has shipped but not yet run says so instead
      of disappearing.
    </p>
    <div id="engines" style="margin-top:0.85rem"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="planes-h">
    <div class="panel__head">
      <h2 id="planes-h">Planes</h2>
      <span class="panel__note">/api/v1/meta · /api/v1/health</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tiles" id="status-tiles"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="engine-h">
    <div class="panel__head">
      <h2 id="engine-h">Engine</h2>
      <span class="panel__note">/api/v1/meta</span>
    </div>
    <div id="engine-meta"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="sources-h">
    <div class="panel__head">
      <h2 id="sources-h">Ingestion sources</h2>
      <span class="panel__note">/api/v1/health · ingestion_log</span>
    </div>
    <div id="sources"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="roadmap-h">
    <div class="panel__head">
      <h2 id="roadmap-h">Contract endpoints</h2>
      <span class="panel__note">FINDYN_V1_SPEC.md §13</span>
    </div>
    <p class="prose">
      Every endpoint the published contract names, probed live. Until an endpoint was delivered the
      API answered <code>501 not_implemented</code> with the milestone that would deliver it, so a
      consumer could tell &ldquo;not built yet&rdquo; from &ldquo;built, but no data&rdquo;. As of
      P3-C none of them answer 501 any more &mdash; the mechanism stays for the engines still to
      come.
    </p>
    <div id="roadmap" style="margin-top:0.85rem"></div>
  </section>
</Base>

<script>
  import '../scripts/status';
  import { mountEngines } from '../scripts/engines';

  void mountEngines('#engines');
</script>
